# qb-pages build context is the static pages + nginx config, nothing else.
# Whitelisting individual files (not the whole nginx/ directory) keeps the
# blast radius fixed: a stray file later dropped into web/nginx/ cannot slip
# into the image. Docker re-includes the named nested file without needing the
# parent directory to be un-ignored.
*
!index.html
!eula.html
!privacy.html
!nginx/default.conf.template
